<p>This scene has <strong>no placed light sources</strong>, but <code>globalLight</code> is on at
darkness 0, so it plays fully lit — it will not leave the party blind. If you want the after-hours
version, raise the scene's darkness level and drop a few lights; the walls are already drawn, so
that is the only work.</p>`;
